## solutions

#### iterative

```js
const removeNode = (head, targetVal) => {
  if (head.val === targetVal) return head.next;

  let current = head;
  let prev = null;
  while (current !== null) {
    if (current.val === targetVal) {
      prev.next = current.next;
      break;
    }
    prev = current;
    current = current.next;
  }

  return head;
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

#### recursive

```js
const removeNode = (head, targetVal) => {
  if (head === null) return null;
  if (head.val === targetVal) return head.next;
  head.next = removeNode(head.next, targetVal);
  return head;
};
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)

