## solutions

#### iterative

```cpp
Node* removeNode(Node* head, std::string targetVal) {
  if (head->val == targetVal) {
    return head->next;
  }

  Node* current = head;
  Node* prev = nullptr;

  while (current != nullptr) {
    if (current->val == targetVal) {
      prev->next = current->next;
      break;
    }

    prev = current;
    current = current->next;
  }
  return head;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(1)

#### recursive

```cpp
Node* removeNode(Node* head, std::string targetVal) {
  if (head == nullptr) {
    return nullptr;
  }

  if (head->val == targetVal) {
    return head->next;
  }

  head->next = removeNode(head->next, targetVal);
  return head;
}
```

- n = number of nodes
- Time: O(n)
- Space: O(n)
